    "description": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is one of the corner saunas that are incredibly popular due to how they feel spacious despite being compact. They fit in the corner and look luxurious. Fitting up to 4 people, these corner saunas are constructed using tough Canadian red cedar wood and feel more spacious than they appear from the outside.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Harvia electric heaters are virtually noiseless and generate heat efficiently, both in terms of energy consumed and time required to heat the air.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The toughness of the materials used along with tempered glass means that these saunas are designed to last a long time. Red Cedar is known for its resilience against mold so even that is not a concern. Besides being luxurious looking from the outside (and inside) they are also comfortable to be in.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you plan to use the sauna regularly and to get the most health benefits you should use the sauna a few times a week, take into account comfort and the unit's longevity.</span></p>\r\n<br />Traditional Heating Technology requires: Hardwire. Hardwire is recommended, if you opt to a plug, we will send you the following plug for the BC45-E heater:",
